 the evil lava. Play Now to escape too! You will make it to the end..", "short_description": "Are you bored of boring or pay2win vr games?\nWell glad thats finally over. Here at Tamarin Escapists VR is alot.\n\nWe would recommend playing on meta quest 3.\nWe drop many good updates, so why not check it out?\n\nPlaying this game helps us grow and drop better updates!\n\nThe game is currently in beta so stuff in future might change!\n\nSo dowload Tamarin Escapists Today!"}]}, "developer_name": "Silence", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/9fa0dc15-c777-4003-8be7-5401bb1aa272", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Silence", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@SilenceVR87", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "8620592361327059"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2987517204720962"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2987517204720962"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1730492160, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2987517204720962"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "8643164859069809", "version": "3"}, "id": "920252379434056", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_o